# Changes from v2:
#  - respawning_visible_spawns() (~3k each) is computed once per turn and reused.
#    v2 computed it up to three times.
#  - Every dash_towards (the costliest block on big maps) is gated on fuel_remaining() > DASH_FUEL.
#    This applies in both go() and the opener. When fuel is short we step instead of dashing.
#  - The low-fuel branch heads for gem camps again (as v0 did), using the shared respawn set.

